- [N5] Node-level omission: i8:However, if the approver is an existing employee of the client, the process continues. (reason: Original conditional flow is fragmented and not faithfully preserved alongside the distorted external path.)
- [N6] Node-level omission: i9:If the form is approved, the recruitment manager sends the form and other documentation, which is received by the client HR. (reason: The step detailing the transmission of the approved form and documentation to client HR is entirely omitted.)
